  "solution": {
    "text": "The number of diagonals in a regular polygon of $n$ sides is given by the following formula ${ }^{n} C_{2}-n$\r\n$\\therefore$ The number of diagonals in a regular polygon of 100 sides\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n={ }^{100} C_{2}-100=\\frac{100 \\cdot 99}{2}-100 \\\\\r\n=\\frac{9900-200}{2}=\\frac{9700}{2}=4850\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$",
